  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759721,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 15 Game for Bandai WonderSwan - Description\n\nStep into a world of geometric puzzles and strategic manipulation with *15 Game for Bandai WonderSwan*! This unique title, developed by Bandai, challenges players to rearrange a series of 15 numbered tiles into sequential order within a grid.  It’s deceptively simple, but mastering the game requires careful planning and spatial reasoning.\n\nThe gameplay revolves around sliding tiles, with each move presenting a new configuration to solve.  The WonderSwan’s directional pad is your primary tool, demanding precision and foresight.  As you progress, the puzzles become increasingly complex, introducing new grid sizes and obstacles. \n\nBeyond the core puzzle mechanic, *15 Game* offers a surprising amount of depth.  Multiple difficulty levels cater to both casual players and seasoned puzzle enthusiasts.  The game’s minimalist aesthetic and calming soundtrack create a focused and meditative experience, perfect for short bursts of gameplay on the go.  Can you conquer the challenge and restore order to the chaos?"
    },
